 to the Imperial Palace by defeating formidable foes who are loyal servants of the King. These boss battles will truly test your skills, precise timing and tactical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/e289018e97cb189105193ca33296d395.poster.avif?t=1785426519\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/e289018e97cb189105193ca33296d395.webm?t=1785426519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/e289018e97cb189105193ca33296d395.mp4?t=1785426519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/211d073b87a578de57d5321d9f401a3e.avif?t=1785426519\" width=609 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Old Capital of Annam filled with mysteries, interconnected areas, hidden paths and deadly elite enemies. Throughout the journey, you will collect multiple weapons, ancient skill texts, rare materials and powerful upgrades to help your Revenant grow ever stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the secret behind the King's immortality and decide the fate of the Old Kingdom. Will you obey the Underworld gods, or choose your own destiny?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Blade Morphosis is an action RPG set in a forsaken kingdom where biomechanical horror meets Eastern folklore. Rise from the dead as the chosen Revenant, morph between multiple forms and master brutally fast-paced combat on your quest to defeat the immortal King of Annam.", "supported_languages": "English, 